    "created_at": "2019-09-19T02:55:33Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-19T02:55:33Z",
    "body": "We should simply change 'descendant' and 'tree order' in '[dialog focusing steps](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/C/#dialog-focusing-steps)' to shadow-aware concepts, right?\r\n\r\n* [shadow-including descendant](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-including-descendant) and [shadow-including tree order](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#concept-shadow-including-tree-order)\r\n* [Flat tree](https://drafts.csswg.org/css-scoping-1/#flat-tree) descendant and order\r\n\r\nWhich one is preferable?",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
